From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 03:38:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Soong build for libv4a_re

Build libv4a_re.so (ViPERFX_RE + the ViPERDSP submodule) with Soong, the
same sources and flags as CMakeLists.txt, as a vendor library installed
in soundfx/ for both ABIs, so a ROM can ship ViPER4Android from source.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WBs6XUfh1pxQ1q9QJe6TLW
---
 Android.bp | 51 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 51 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 Android.bp

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3093f2a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@
+//
+// Soong build of libv4a_re (ViPERFX_RE + ViPERDSP) for ROMs that ship
+// ViPER4Android in the vendor image. Mirrors CMakeLists.txt; the ViPERDSP
+// submodule is expected at ViPERDSP/ (a separate repo project).
+//
+// The audio HAL loads it from /vendor/lib{,64}/soundfx, as listed in the
+// device's audio_effects.xml:
+//   <library name="v4a_re" path="libv4a_re.so"/>
+//   <effect name="v4a_standard_re" library="v4a_re"
+//           uuid="90380da3-8536-4744-a6a3-5731970e640f"/>
+//
+
+cc_library_shared {
+    name: "libv4a_re",
+    vendor: true,
+    relative_install_path: "soundfx",
+    compile_multilib: "both",
+
+    srcs: [
+        "src/ViPER4Android.cpp",
+        "src/ViperContext.cpp",
+        "ViPERDSP/viper/ViPER.cpp",
+        "ViPERDSP/viper/effects/*.cpp",
+        "ViPERDSP/viper/utils/*.cpp",
+        "ViPERDSP/viper/utils/pffft.c",
+    ],
+    local_include_dirs: [
+        "src",
+        "src/include",
+        "ViPERDSP/include",
+        "ViPERDSP",
+    ],
+    shared_libs: ["liblog"],
+
+    cflags: [
+        "-O3",
+        "-DNDEBUG",
+        "-DVERSION_CODE=20261009",
+        "-DVERSION_NAME=\"v2.1.1\"",
+        "-ffunction-sections",
+        "-fdata-sections",
+        "-fvisibility=hidden",
+        "-Wall",
+        "-Wno-unused-parameter",
+        "-Wno-unused-variable",
+        "-Wno-unused-function",
+    ],
+    cppflags: ["-fvisibility-inlines-hidden"],
+    cpp_std: "gnu++17",
+    ldflags: ["-Wl,--gc-sections"],
+}
-- 
